Short:        Source for 40kb intro: Apathy/PowerLine
Author:       Henrik Magnusson (Raylight)
Uploader:     druid powerline goteborg mail telia com
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

 Full source code for 40kb intro, released at The Party 5, by PowerLine.
 Compatible with PhxAss 4.18+ (© Frank Wille). Contains:

 - 2*2, Full Screen Zoom Rotator

 - Copper Wall

 - Highly Optimized Dot Tunnel

 - Support Routines, eg. Fading, Syncronization, Memory Management.

 - All Graphics and Music

 - Needed Compilation Scripts

 Uses The Player 6.1A (© Jarno Paananen). Reproduction needs permission from
 the authors. Quick contact: chip@toaster.joy.se
